      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I will be happy to read the chatbox value in OSC.\n\nI often miss my friend's chatboxes and receiving OSC would help me to notice them.\n\nTTS system is a good application example.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
